    "name": {
      "value": "Pilgrim"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "pc2"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "In your youth, you made several pilgrimages to important shrines and sacred sites. You might have been a mendicant friar, a seller of religious relics (real or fraudulent), or just a simple farmer following the dictates of your faith. Whatever the aims of your wanderings now, your faith still protects you on the road.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Charisma, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Religion skill and the Lore skill for your patron deity. You gain the Pilgrim's Token skill feat."
    },
